    {
      "slot": "2026-11-05:quote-v1:31",
      "due_at": "2026-11-05T18:38:00+00:00",
      "text": "BREAKING — Hy4 is now available in OpenCode Go\n\nThe release of Hy4 in OpenCode Go adds a new tool to the platform's offerings. Developers can now access Hy4 as part of their workflow.",
      "event_key": "Hy4 available in OpenCode Go",
      "premise": "Hy4 is now available in OpenCode Go.",
      "source_id": "2118135093617393774",
      "author": "opencode",
      "source_url": "https://x.com/opencode/status/2118135093617393774",
      "source_views": 101656,
      "source_checked_at": "2026-11-05T19:09:06.326427+00:00",
      "source_created_at": "2026-11-05T00:15:34+00:00",
      "tweet_id": "2118420365181657357",
      "posted_at": "2026-11-05T19:09:08.361331+00:00"
    },
    {
      "slot": "2026-11-06:quote-v1:0",
      "due_at": "2026-11-06T00:06:00+00:00",
      "text": "BREAKING — Cursor now allows users to build live apps and share them with a link\n\nCursor's new feature enables users to describe a tool, which the platform then builds, sets up a database for, runs security checks on, and deploys.",
      "event_key": "Cursor Live App Builder Release",
      "premise": "Cursor now allows users to build live apps and share them with a link, including setting up a database, running security checks, and deploying.",
      "source_id": "2118458629091426304",
      "author": "cursor_ai",
      "source_url": "https://x.com/cursor_ai/status/2118458629091426304",
      "source_views": 126810,
      "source_checked_at": "2026-11-06T00:31:15.751694+00:00",
      "source_created_at": "2026-11-05T21:41:10+00:00",
      "tweet_id": "2118501438280323151",
      "posted_at": "2026-11-06T00:31:17.692865+00:00"
    },
    {
      "slot": "2026-11-06:quote-v1:1",
      "due_at": "2026-11-06T00:40:00+00:00",
      "text": "BREAKING — GPT-6 Cyber launched with stronger security research capabilities\n\nGPT-6 Cyber, a security research model, is now available to select Daybreak Red customers and has been used for Linux kernel research.",
      "event_key": "Introducing GPT-6 Cyber Security Model",
      "premise": "OpenAI introduced GPT-6 Cyber, a security research model with stronger capabilities and better alignment, used for Linux kernel research and adopted by security teams at Mozilla, Palo Alto Networks, Cisco, and OpenAI.",
      "source_id": "2118390190246879554",
      "author": "OpenAI",
      "source_url": "https://x.com/OpenAI/status/2118390190246879554",
      "source_views": 1593909,
      "source_checked_at": "2026-11-06T00:56:24.129235+00:00",
      "source_created_at": "2026-11-05T17:09:13+00:00",
      "tweet_id": "2118507764733628717",
      "posted_at": "2026-11-06T00:56:26.023017+00:00"
    },
    {
      "slot": "2026-11-06:quote-v1:10",
      "due_at": "2026-11-06T06:07:00+00:00",
      "text": "BREAKING — Google reports: Gemini Omni 1.2 Flash updates video generation with faster processing and lower cost.\n\nThe report says the model offers 30% lower cost at $0.07/s for 360p or 720p drafts, which can be upscaled to 1080p or 4K.",
      "event_key": "Gemini Omni 1.2 Flash video generation model update",
      "premise": "Google announces Gemini Omni 1.2 Flash, an updated video generation model with stronger consistency, more creative control, faster processing, and lower cost.",
      "source_id": "2118390406316728555",
      "author": "Google",
      "source_url": "https://x.com/Google/status/2118390406316728555",
      "source_views": 470130,
      "source_checked_at": "2026-11-06T06:20:16.366782+00:00",
      "source_created_at": "2026-11-05T17:10:05+00:00",
      "tweet_id": "2118589268490854501",
      "posted_at": "2026-11-06T06:20:18.020721+00:00"
    },
    {
      "slot": "2026-11-06:quote-v1:11",
      "due_at": "2026-11-06T06:43:00+00:00",
      "text": "BREAKING — AravSrinivas reports: Perplexity Teammates launch as personal agents for work, shifting from prompt writing to goal-setting. \n\nThe report says the feature is rolling out to Max users on the web today, with native apps coming soon.",
      "event_key": "Perplexity Teammates Launch",
      "premise": "Perplexity Teammates are launched as personal agents for work, changing the paradigm from writing prompts to giving high-level goals. Rolling out to Max users on the web today, with native apps coming soon.",
      "source_id": "2118388400730591469",
      "author": "AravSrinivas",
      "source_url": "https://x.com/AravSrinivas/status/2118388400730591469",
      "source_views": 123360,
      "source_checked_at": "2026-11-06T07:05:37.540062+00:00",
      "source_created_at": "2026-11-05T17:02:07+00:00",
      "tweet_id": "2118600682987192379",
      "posted_at": "2026-11-06T07:05:39.446109+00:00"
    },
    {
      "slot": "2026-11-06:quote-v1:12",
      "due_at": "2026-11-06T07:14:00+00:00",
      "text": "BREAKING — NousResearch reports: Hermes Agent v0.23.0 released with desktop in a browser tab, group chats with automatic routing, and spend limits for paid tools.\n\nThe report says the update includes a lighter and faster version of the platform.",
      "event_key": "Hermes Agent v0.23.0 Release",
      "premise": "Hermes Agent v0.23.0 is released with highlights including desktop in a browser tab, one gateway for every conversation, /Rewind, group chats with automatic routing, spend limits for paid tools, and being lighter and faster.",
      "source_id": "2118479744979079669",
      "author": "NousResearch",
      "source_url": "https://x.com/NousResearch/status/2118479744979079669",
      "source_views": 382747,
      "source_checked_at": "2026-11-06T07:41:26.632138+00:00",
      "source_created_at": "2026-11-05T23:05:05+00:00",
      "tweet_id": "2118609695896375697",
      "posted_at": "2026-11-06T07:41:28.278738+00:00"
    },
    {
      "slot": "2026-11-06:quote-v1:14",
      "due_at": "2026-11-06T08:28:00+00:00",
      "text": "BREAKING — DeepAI reports: The best coding AI costs up to $500 a month. We made it free.\n\nThe report says DeepAI Code offers free access to Claude Fable 5.1, GPT-6 Astra, and Claude Opus 5.5 in a daily allowance, with fast models free and no limits.",
      "event_key": "DeepAI Code: Free Access to Claude Fable 5.1, GPT-6 Astra, and Claude Opus 5.5",
      "premise": "DeepAI announces free access to Claude Fable 5.1, GPT-6 Astra, and Claude Opus 5.5 in a daily allowance, with fast models free and no limits.",
      "source_id": "2118313957907652831",
      "author": "DeepAI",
      "source_url": "https://x.com/DeepAI/status/2118313957907652831",
      "source_views": 160351,
      "source_checked_at": "2026-11-06T08:31:18.868137+00:00",
      "source_created_at": "2026-11-05T12:06:18+00:00",
      "tweet_id": "2118622245639647369",
      "posted_at": "2026-11-06T08:31:20.359905+00:00"
    },
    {
      "slot": "2026-11-06:quote-v1:15",
      "due_at": "2026-11-06T09:03:00+00:00",
      "text": "BREAKING — METR_Evals reports: METR publishes risk assessment on AI accelerating AI development\n\nThe report says a team within METR has been evaluating whether AI is accelerating AI development, using internal Anthropic information since August.",
      "event_key": "METR Report on AI Accelerating AI Development",
      "premise": "Reported by METR_Evals: A team within METR has worked with internal Anthropic information to assess whether AI is accelerating AI development and is now publishing a report summarizing the results of this risk assessment.",
      "source_id": "2118412183860351084",
      "author": "METR_Evals",
      "source_url": "https://x.com/METR_Evals/status/2118412183860351084",
      "source_views": 881985,
      "source_checked_at": "2026-11-06T09:03:10.042793+00:00",
      "source_created_at": "2026-11-05T18:36:37+00:00",
      "tweet_id": "2118630262619934929",
      "posted_at": "2026-11-06T09:03:11.748661+00:00"
    },
    {
      "slot": "2026-11-06:quote-v1:16",
      "due_at": "2026-11-06T09:39:00+00:00",
      "text": "BREAKING — OfficialLoganK reports: Gemini Omni Flash 1.2 launched with 15-second video generation and 30% lower price.\n\nThe report says the update includes deeper cinematic controls, multi-turn conversation editing, and less visual drift.",
      "event_key": "Gemini Omni Flash 1.2 release with longer video generation and price reduction",
      "premise": "Gemini Omni Flash 1.2 is rolled out with longer video generation (15 seconds), deeper cinematic controls, multi-turn conversation editing, less visual drift, and 30% lower price than Omni Flash 1.1.",
      "source_id": "2118390838434693281",
      "author": "OfficialLoganK",
      "source_url": "https://x.com/OfficialLoganK/status/2118390838434693281",
      "source_views": 112008,
      "source_checked_at": "2026-11-06T10:11:51.232102+00:00",
      "source_created_at": "2026-11-05T17:11:48+00:00",
      "tweet_id": "2118647547774574933",
      "posted_at": "2026-11-06T10:11:52.854286+00:00"
    },
    {
      "slot": "2026-11-06:quote-v1:17",
      "due_at": "2026-11-06T10:19:00+00:00",
      "text": "BREAKING — GoogleAIStudio reports: Gemini Omni 1.2 Flash now available in AI Studio and the Gemini API\n\nThe report says the update includes faster processing, 30% lower cost, and longer video generation.",
      "event_key": "Gemini Omni 1.2 Flash release",
      "premise": "Introducing Gemini Omni 1.2 Flash, now available in AI Studio and the Gemini API.",
      "source_id": "2118390015382454491",
