      "slot": "2026-11-06:quote-v1:19",
      "due_at": "2026-11-06T11:30:00+00:00",
      "text": "BREAKING — thinkymachines reports: Inkling 2 Small scores 31 on the AA Intelligence Index, a significant jump from its predecessor.\n\nThe report says the model is available for fine-tuning and inference on Tinker, with full weights to follow.",
      "event_key": "Inkling 2 Small Released with AA Intelligence Index Score 31",
      "premise": "Inkling 2 Small is introduced with a score of 31 on the AA Intelligence Index and is available for fine-tuning and inference on Tinker, with full weight release planned soon.",
      "source_id": "2118489527362912566",
