      "due_at": "2026-11-06T12:43:00+00:00",
      "text": "BREAKING — fia reports: The YANGWANG U9 Xtreme achieves 503.17 km/h, first production car to exceed 500 km/h.\n\nThe report says the FIA has officially recognized the speed, marking a milestone in electric vehicle technology.",
      "event_key": "YANGWANG U9 Xtreme breaks 500 km/h barrier",
      "premise": "Reported by fia: The YANGWANG U9 Xtreme achieved a top speed of 503.17 km/h in Abu Dhabi, becoming the first production car to surpass 500 km/h, recognized by the FIA.",
